abstract: "Open source release of BiDexHand V4, a robotic hand featuring 16 degrees of freedom. It utilizes a cable-and-pulley system, with 15 servos arranged in N configuration to drive its 15 joints with tendon, and a 4-bar linkage driven 16th joint."
